WEBVTT

00:05:28.205 --> 00:05:30.146
Who will pay for that?

00:05:30.146 --> 00:05:32.108
Shareholders? Customers?

00:05:32.108 --> 00:05:33.439
No, they will refuse.

00:05:33.439 --> 00:05:36.248
So who is left? 
The employees,

00:05:36.248 --> 00:05:38.956
who have to compensate through their super

00:05:38.956 --> 00:05:42.276
individual efforts for the lack of cooperation.

00:05:42.276 --> 00:05:45.944
Stress, burnout, they are 
overwhelmed, accidents.

00:05:45.944 --> 00:05:48.768
No wonder they disengage.

00:05:48.768 --> 00:05:52.565
How do the hard and the soft
try to foster cooperation?

00:05:52.565 --> 00:05:57.195
The hard: In banks, when there is a problem

00:05:57.195 --> 00:06:00.255
between the back office and the front office,